=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.mygatsby.com\/wedding-invitations.html\"&gt;make their own invitations&lt;\/a&gt;!&amp;nbsp; I cannot believe how amazing your invitations truly are!&amp;nbsp; I keep looking at them, imagining if I can emulate them!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1501491,"PostDate":1312865595,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I just have to reiterate that I am completely impressed with people who have the time, energy, and (most of all) the talent to <a href='http:\/\/www.mygatsby.com\/wedding-invitations.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>make their own invitations<\/a>!\u00a0 I cannot believe how amazing your invitations truly are!\u00a0 I keep looking at them, imagining if I can emulate them!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lkechb@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1310530754,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242260.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lkech","Id":242260,"Name":"lkech","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f7053204af5994044a3b9e6b3a3a401b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; thank you for sharing!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1544129,"PostDate":1320768168,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> thank you for sharing!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nadiacruz06@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1320719407,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247468.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":142,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ncruz06","Id":247468,"Name":"ncruz06","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5d883ce5f2855340ad22ee737b02919c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I LOVE the yellow damask pattern you have here.&amp;nbsp; I have been looking for a yellow damask pattern, but they are all either too ornate, too floral, or way too simple!&amp;nbsp; Where did you find it?&amp;nbsp; Or did you design it yourself?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1580728,"PostDate":1328884488,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I LOVE the yellow damask pattern you have here.\u00a0 I have been looking for a yellow damask pattern, but they are all either too ornate, too floral, or way too simple!\u00a0 Where did you find it?\u00a0 Or did you design it yourself?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"duerk.lauren@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1328884328,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251238.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"duerkld","Id":251238,"Name":"duerkld","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b0e540312840eb09f2dcb9566c05e449","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; thanks so much for posting these instructions..there gonna be so helpful!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1580739,"PostDate":1328886300,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> thanks so much for posting these instructions..there gonna be so helpful!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"caitlin.tracey@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"104.63.76.243","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1328031611,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250779.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Speckles121","Id":250779,"Name":"Speckles121","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0e178c71255939390561145a347ae9be","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Love these! So glad I found them. Th edetailed instructions are perfect, I&#039;m going to mock one up tonight!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; How much did it cost you per-invite for postage?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1580754,"PostDate":1328888684,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Love these! So glad I found them. Th edetailed instructions are perfect, I'm going to mock one up tonight!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> How much did it cost you per-invite for postage?<\/p> <p> Thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jamiecwilkie@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"205.211.113.30","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1301680597,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238428.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":139,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"J and G 2012","Id":238428,"Name":"J and G 2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f42a7b0c4c5e150ce4a032bd4cafabc1","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Starfish0512[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n These are gorgeous! Clean, simple yet make a statement!  Where did you find the yellow damask print?!  I have been searching through dreamstime, found a few but not exactly what I want.  Looking for a classic damask in navy blue\/white...  Great Job!!![\/quote] \n \n \n Sorry I&#039;m replying so late! If you&#039;re still looking for this damask print I can send it to you. I have it in vector format so it can be changed to any colour. Just shoot me a private message if you need it.","Attachments":[],"Id":1580788,"PostDate":1328893537,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Starfish0512<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> These are gorgeous! Clean, simple yet make a statement!\u00a0 Where did you find the yellow damask print?!\u00a0 I have been searching through dreamstime, found a few but not exactly what I want.\u00a0 Looking for a classic damask in navy blue\/white...\u00a0 Great Job!!!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> Sorry I'm replying so late! If you're still looking for this damask print I can send it to you. I have it in vector format so it can be changed to any colour. Just shoot me a private message if you need it.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sailor_x_8@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1289426907,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233856.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"X-Chan","Id":233856,"Name":"X-Chan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dce7d71520221a60a6db1035dc679cbe","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]J and G 2012[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Love these! So glad I found them. Th edetailed instructions are perfect, I&#039;m going to mock one up tonight! \n \n How much did it cost you per-invite for postage? \n Thanks![\/quote] \n \n \n Thanks so much! I don&#039;t remember exactly how much I had to pay per invite for postage. They were just slightly over the standard letter weight limit so instead of 50 cents ea or so, It was more like $1.00-$1.20 I think. That is for within Canada, it was about twice as much internationally.  \n \n Just looked at my budget sheet and it says I spent $113 on invitations postage and that was for about 70 invitations to various destinations. Hope that helps!","Attachments":[],"Id":1580793,"PostDate":1328893763,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>J and G 2012<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Love these! So glad I found them. Th edetailed instructions are perfect, I'm going to mock one up tonight!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> How much did it cost you per-invite for postage?<\/p> <p> Thanks!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> Thanks so much! I don't remember exactly how much I had to pay per invite for postage. They were just slightly over the standard letter weight limit so instead of 50 cents ea or so, It was more like $1.00-$1.20 I think. That is for within Canada, it was about twice as much internationally.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Just looked at my budget sheet and it says I spent $113 on invitations postage and that was for about 70 invitations to various destinations. Hope that helps!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sailor_x_8@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1289426907,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233856.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"X-Chan","Id":233856,"Name":"X-Chan","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","