 It&#039;s easier for us to learn about it. Copied!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1446417,"PostDate":1304552546,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey it's so beautiful! I wish I have a talent like yours as an illustrator. You really don't need a big budget for the invitations. You've actually doing a great job on it. And yeah thanks for the instructions. It's easier for us to learn about it. Copied!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lisamatterni@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1290589414,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-234174.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LisaMatterni","Id":234174,"Name":"LisaMatterni","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":60891,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43bcf6fde30557218e4be5b2e2d20af9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I love these!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1454997,"PostDate":1305860688,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc